# Docker build context allow-list.
#
# All three images build from the repository root, so without this file every
# `docker build` ships the entire working tree to the daemon: the diagnostic
# renders under testdata/ (tens of megabytes of page images of real documents),
# .git, .env, uploads/, logs/, openspec/ and __pycache__ included. Anything not
# re-included below never reaches the daemon.
*
!.gitignore
!requirements.txt
!*.deb
!file_translator/
!static/
!admin_service/
!oda-converter/
!docs/